---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Node — KEJINCAI.DEV"
  description="Ke Jincai, a software engineer based in Tokyo. Interested in AI, software engineering, data, language and photography."
>
  <div class="container page-content about-page">
    <div class="page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow cyan">ABOUT NODE</p>
      <h1>
        KE JINCAI<span class="name-dot">.</span>
      </h1>
      <p>Software Engineer based in Tokyo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-story">
        <h2 lang="ja">作る。学ぶ。記録する。</h2>
        <div lang="zh-CN">
          <p>这里是我的个人数字节点。</p>
          <p>
            用来收录软件项目、AI
            实验、学习记录与数字作品。在东京，持续构建、学习和记录。
          </p>
          <p>每一个项目都是一次探索。每一条记录，都是理解世界的一小步。</p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="text-link micro"
          href={site.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          FIND ME ON GITHUB ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="interests">
        <h2 class="micro">INTERESTED IN</h2>
        <ol>
          {[
            'AI',
            'Software Engineering',
            'Data',
            'Language',
            'Photography',
          ].map((interest, i) => (
            <li>
              <span class="micro">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              {interest}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-end mono">
      <span>TOKYO / PERSONAL NODE</span>
      <span class="online">
        <i></i> KEEP BUILDING
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
